==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Due to the Shy Boy, any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] or [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] will be good here. For Metal Hippoe, you could bring a [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critical Hitter]] or just use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] or one of his variants.

